(8, 'Hannah Melotto', 'h.melotto@melottogroup.com', '2158218810', 'Booking Enquiry', 'Hey! Do you have any use for a freelance writer? I have nearly a decade of experience and can help with pretty much any type of content, including blog posts, case studies, press releases, thought leadership, articles, and much more. I\'m currently looking for new opportunities and would love to see if you have any writing projects I could help with. You can book a time with me to chat if interested. Hoping to connect! https://calendly.com/melottogroup/30min', 'resolved', '', '2026-08-31 06:33:12', '2026-09-29 06:17:48'),
