(12, 'Emma Clarke', 'emma@leadaso.com', '+44 20 7946 0958', 'Partner Support', 'Hi!\n\nI\'m Emma from ASO Scout. Congrats on launching Beyomo Partner.\n\nI searched \"partner\" in the US App Store. Beyomo Partner isn\'t in the top 200.\n\nThat\'s decided by three fields: your title, your subtitle, and the keyword field nobody sees. Nothing else on your page counts.\n\nHere\'s where you show up, how often it\'s searched, and what you\'re missing:\n\nhttps://asoscout.com/app/6793929294?storefront=us&c=form-2026-09-15\n\n--\nEmma Clarke\nASO Scout', 'in_progress', '', '2026-09-15 17:26:15', '2026-09-24 10:16:52'),
